<title>USA: Digital Video files for secondary offering.</title>
<headline>Digital Video files for secondary offering.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Video Systems Inc said it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a secondary public offering of $26,450,000, including an over-allotment option, of its securities, consisting of units of common stock and warrants.</p>
<p>D.H. Blair Investment Banking Corp is the underwriter of the offering.</p>
